// name :
"P3900829254" "A Quotidian Ragbag (First Ward Pt. 1)"
// flashbackteamrequiresfailedtext :
"P2810900513" "You and everyone on your team must be unable to obtain this Story Arc in the normal timestream to begin flashback. You must also all be VIP or have purchased the First Ward from the Paragon Market."
// teamrequiresfailedtext :
