// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2271471068" "Talk to Cheshire, the Survivor Compound's Gatekeeper"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P494854345" "{HeroName}, what's wrong with you, child? Speak to the Gatekeeper, y'hear? I need my peoples out of that prison, quick-like."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3092201837" "You spoke to the Gatekeeper of the Survivor Compound. Evidently, visitation rights to meet with the captive Carnival troupers requires the permission of the Compound's leader. Normally, this would be the Monarch, but he is currently indisposed, which means you'll have to talk to the Hetman instead. An audience with the Hetman can be achieved by getting an endorsement from a local elder, Billystick."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2525531261" "Talk to Billystick"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1285616690" "So you get past the gate and decide to stroll all the way back here, do ya? That makes no lick of sense. Get back to the Compound and find out a way to release my fellows in the Carnival."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P219357952" "Billystick, one of the Compound elders, has given you his endorsement to speak with the Hetman. You're one step closer to getting visitation rights to see the imprisoned members of the Carnival of Light. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1091502073" "Talk to the Hetman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2058336993" "Hoo boy, {HeroName}, I swear you jes sleepwalkin' right before my eyes. Get back to the Compound, you fool chil'. There's work to be done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P425571612" "The Hetman wants a favor done before he will let you speak with the Carnival prisoners. You need to take down a cell of D.U.S.T. Rangers that have been plaguing the Compound recently. The Hetman isn't sure exactly where they've set up camp, but he's sent you out into the rest of First Ward to discover whether D.U.S.T. is conducting any operations this far from their normal territory. When you find out the location of the D.U.S.T. cell near the Compound, you'll have to drive them away and return to the Hetman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1978146436" "Defeat D.U.S.T. Rangers to discover the location of their Cell hideout near the Compound"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P812530277" "Big top almighty, {Hero.gender=male boy|girl}! If the only way to get my peoples out of their cages is to rough up some D.U.S.T. Rangers, then do it already!"
// VillainDescription :
"P1802244910" "Defeat {Remain} D.U.S.T. soldiers in First Ward"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P4179927215" "Defeat one more D.U.S.T. soldier in First Ward"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2312664051" "You've learned the staging ground of the D.U.S.T. cell near the Compound and the name of its commanding officer, Captain Muldoon."

