// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 3 Actor2 :
"P659294204" "<t=3 d=4>My beautiful Antebellum! It really is you!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1959009234" "<t=3 d=4>What twisted deception is this? You're not my father.<em lecture t=3 d=4>While you labored on all those portraits of me, did you once think to paint yourself?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P580439787" "<em shrug t=3 d=4>What do you mean? Why look on me with such disdain? Why deem this reunion so foul or fueled by deceit?"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2913261023" "<t=2 d=4>If you think you are my father, then think of his face. It does not match your own, Monarch.<em lecture t=3 d=4>What's wrong, milord? Is it unraveling for you now, the consequences of such a mismatched visage? <em point t=3 d=3>Good! Now tell me who you REALLY are!"
// 6 Actor2 :
"P877550286" "<em frustrated t=3 d=5>You will mind your tongue, daughter. I have suffered so much to find you...<em angry t=3 d=3>...YOU WILL NOT LEAVE HERE UNTIL YOU CALL ME KIN!"
